  "body": "Your sea change starts here!  \r\n\r\nSet on a 661m² freehold section in The Ritz, arguably one of Orewa's finest streets, this solid 240sqm (approximately) brick and tile home is on the market for the first time ever.\r\n\r\nSunshine follows you from morning to evening, and the sea views do too. You'll catch them from the main living areas, the east-facing bedrooms and the garden.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, a large kitchen with generous workspace and storage flows into two generous living areas and the dining space, so there's room to cook, gather and spread out.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms suit families, guests or working from home. The enormous main master bedroom suite has its own ensuite and opens onto a sunlit morning patio with sea views. With everything on one level, it works just as well for young families as for downsizers.\r\n\r\nOutside, a concrete path circles the home, and in the garden your own citrus grove keeps the vitamin C flowing, with a fig tree to be envied. \r\n\r\nExtensive paving makes outdoor living easy, and the double garage adds secure parking and storage. The beach, cafés, shops, motorway access and schools are all close by.\r\n\r\nThe care taken over the years is clear, and the original interior is ready for its next chapter. Move in and enjoy it as it is, or modernise at your own pace to the standard this home deserves. Be quick to view!\r\n\r\nAUCTION on site, 9th November 1pm (Unless Sold Prior)\r\n\r\n************\r\nDisclaimer: While every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of these particulars, no warranty is given by the vendor or the agent as to their accuracy. Interested parties should not rely on these particulars as representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise. Although high standards have been used in preparing this document, no legal responsibility can be accepted for any loss or damage resulting from the content or use of this information. Any photographs show only certain parts of the property as they appeared when taken, and some photographs may have been digitally enhanced for marketing purposes. Areas, amounts, measurements, distances, and all other numerical information are approximate only.\r\n\r\nNote: Every care has been taken to verify the accuracy of the details in this advertisement. However, its accuracy cannot be guaranteed. Prospective purchasers are requested to take necessary action to satisfy themselves with any pertinent matters.",
